### ItemValueTrade::Config ###
Empty by default - no trade currently costs anything. Each <Fee> charges
the listed amount once per matching item found in either player's trade
slots (multiplied by the item's stack/durability count for stackable
items), on top of the normal trade.
  Index   Item id (GET_ITEM(Section,SubIndex) - see Item.xml).
  Zen     Zen charged per matching item.
  Coin1   WCoinC charged per matching item.
  Coin2   WCoinP charged per matching item.
  Coin3   GoblinPoint charged per matching item.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

